# Polymarket credentials template.
#
# Copy this file to ./.credentials (gitignored) and fill in real values, or set
# the same keys as POLYMARKET_* environment variables. Keys are case-insensitive;
# lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Full reference: skills/polymarket-trade/references/credentials.md
#
# IMPORTANT: Polymarket email/Magic and browser logins hold your USDC and
# positions in a PROXY wallet, not the signer/EOA. Point the skills at the proxy
# via POLYMARKET_FUNDER, or positions/balance will look empty. Copy the proxy
# address from the logged-in Polymarket profile URL (polymarket.com/@0x...) or
# the top-right account menu.

# --- Trading: required ---
POLYMARKET_PRIVATE_KEY=0xYourPrivateKey
POLYMARKET_API_KEY=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POLYMARKET_API_SECRET=base64-secret==
POLYMARKET_API_PASSPHRASE=hex-passphrase
POLYMARKET_FUNDER=0xYourProxyWallet          # proxy that holds funds/positions
POLYMARKET_SIGNATURE_TYPE=1                   # 0 EOA, 1 email/Magic, 2 browser, 3 deposit

# --- Optional ---
POLYMARKET_ADDRESS=0xYourSignerEOA           # informational; FUNDER fallback
# POLYMARKET_BEARER_TOKEN=...                 # query skill historical-price auth only

# --- Ignored by the skills (keep your recovery code secret elsewhere) ---
# RECOVERYCODE=...
